OL,3,AMy student day out in London turned to
OL,4,Aterror - now survivors like me won't be
OL,5,Aforgotten
OL,6,
OL,7,FTravis Frain was texting his mates a
OL,8,Fphoto he had just taken of Big Ben on a
OL,9,Funiversity trip to London when his day
OL,10,Fturned from normal to anything but.
OL,12,F"One of the guys in my group shouted
OL,13,F'look out' and as I looked up from my
OL,14,Fphone the terrorist's car was in front
OL,15,Fof me.
OL,17,F"It was a split second really before
OL,18,Fthe car hit me. I went over the bonnet,
OL,19,Finto the air, before landing back on
OL,20,Fthe ground."
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
